hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1600","Ahmad bin 'Abdah narrated to us, and Hammad bin Zayd narrated to us, and Muhammad bin Ziyad narrated to us, on the authority of Abu Hurayrah (RA), who reported: \"Muhammad (ﷺ), or Abu al-Qasim (ﷺ) [the Prophet’s honorific kunya], said: 'Does he who raises his head before the Imam not fear that Allah will turn his head into the head of a donkey?'\""
